{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/41742-a-few-questions-and-thoughts","id":41742,"title":"A few questions and thoughts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-03T08:44:50-08:00","id":41742,"title":"A few questions and thoughts","content":"Hello!<br /> <br /> I LOVE the new Demon book, and I even created an account after lurking in this forum for ever and a day since I like it so much! With that said, I have a few questions, thought the community might help with insight! I apologize in advance if I missed a topic that covered these questions <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I am trying to avoid a plethora of house rules, and do not want to accidentally stray from the main themes of the game.<br /> <br /> Incarnations:<br /> <br /> 1. Is it just me, or does very little separate the incarnations other than role-play? <br /> 2. Do embeds have different costs for ' in incarnation' embeds (Does a Destoyer pay less for Cacophony embeds, for instance) since each Incarnation has an 'affinity' for a specific category of Embeds. What does affinity mean rule-wise if it is not difference in XP cost?<br /> 3. Might that extend to Exploits (ie, one of the prerequisites is a Cacophony embed, so you get a discount in purchasing it!) <br /> 4. Has anyone come up conditions that each Incarnation has, or anything else to differentiate them some more?<br /> <br /> Angels<br /> <br /> 5. To make it simpler, might it be easier to replace Numina with embeds/exploits or does that break the 'difference' concept between demons and angels- thoughts?<br /> <br /> <br /> Memories of the God-Machine<br /> <br /> 6. I was thinking of maybe coming up with a memory merit to give additional insight into past missions for the god-machine... maybe the more you have the more missions you had since being created or reconstituted? Maybe it can give you bonuses on rolls or insight into specific projects?<br /> 7. When an angel falls does it start demonhood knowing fully about infrastructure it had just used, where it was created, the existence of demons etc? I know some of that is covered the prequel stuff, but is there a baseline of knowledge that all new demons have?<br /> <br /> <br /> Just some thoughts and questions- insights or scoldings welcome!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1895-chriszeke3","name":"ChrisZeke3","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-03T10:24:23-08:00","id":41816,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChrisZeke3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/41742-a-few-questions-and-thoughts#post41742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1. Is it just me, or does very little separate the incarnations other than role-play?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's about the size of it. Messengers include both speakers and listeners, Y2K (an angel whose only job is to sit in a box and filter data) is a Guardian, and Destroyers exist spanning the entire scale of targeted destruction \u2014 they're very broad categories that might include specimens not made with much use for more than a handful of their affinity category's effects.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 2. Do embeds have different costs for ' in incarnation' embeds (Does a Destoyer pay less for Cacophony embeds, for instance) since each Incarnation has an 'affinity' for a specific category of Embeds. What does affinity mean rule-wise if it is not difference in XP cost? </div> </div> </div>Affinity is chiefly important when picking starting Embeds \u2014 you'll always have at least one in-affinity \u2014 and when going loud \u2014 you get access to every affinity Embed for the scene.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 3. Might that extend to Exploits (ie, one of the prerequisites is a Cacophony embed, so you get a discount in purchasing it!) </div> </div> </div>Doesn't work like that \u2014 Exploits can theoretically use Embeds from any category as their prerequisite as long as the individual power provides some principle than can be extrapolated into the Exploit \u2014 and further isn't borne out by the way Exploits function when going loud \u2014 you can use any of them for the duration of the scene.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Angels<br /> 5. To make it simpler, might it be easier to replace Numina with embeds/exploits or does that break the 'difference' concept between demons and angels- thoughts? </div> </div> </div>Embeds are kosher, Exploits are definitely not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-03T13:10:24-08:00","id":41908,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChrisZeke3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/41742-a-few-questions-and-thoughts#post41742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">5. To make it simpler, might it be easier to replace Numina with embeds/exploits or does that break the 'difference' concept between demons and angels- thoughts?</div> </div> </div> </div>I would preserve the differences between them. Like Satchel, Embeds would be okay, but most of those could be covered with Numina and Influences (and Infrastructure), anyway. But one of the many things demon philosophers can wonder about is the difference in powers between demons and angels. It's interesting that angels don't use Aether or Embeds/Exploits. The mechanical differences have far-reaching implications both IC and OOC. That's something fun to play with. Demons don't know whether it's part of the Machine's plans or if they truly exist outside God's design now. Angels find the freedom and alienness of demonic powers terrifying. Run with that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-03T19:57:00-08:00","id":42112,"title":"","content":"Lots of good insight, thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1895-chriszeke3","name":"ChrisZeke3","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}